# Copy to .sandcastle/.env and fill in — operator-local, gitignored (the runner
# refuses a git-tracked .env). Loaded --env-file style.
#
# A TARGET dotenv holds ONE secret: GH_TOKEN. The non-secret project facts
# (image, testCommand, checkCommands, setupCommand) live in the committed,
# code-reviewed config.json — not here. You MAY override the env-backed three
# (IMAGE / CHECK_COMMANDS / SETUP_COMMAND) below for local dev; an override here
# wins over config.json. Precedence:
#   shell env > this .env > config.json > runner .env > default.

# --- GitHub auth (HOST only) -----------------------------------------------
# Used on the host by `gh issue view` to fetch the slice spec for --issue. NOT
# injected into the sandbox. Scope: Issues read. This fork is
# lauragrechenko/codegraph — use a token for the account that can see it.
GH_TOKEN=

# --- Agent credential (optional) -------------------------------------------
# Only if this project runs on its own account rather than the runner's.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_KEY=            # under AGENT=codex

# --- Local overrides (optional; committed home is config.json) ---------------
# IMAGE=sandcastle:theseus
# CHECK_COMMANDS=npm run check --workspace ui
# SETUP_COMMAND=npm ci && npm run build
